  "details": "1. Open an instance of https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_778e1f0e-7209-406a-ab45-e97cdd5aa267/info\n\n2. Look at the spot in the screenshot. There is a mystery collider, but only on open beta.\n\n3. If you click this, you sit sideways, and cannot leave the station without respawning.\n\nIs this related to the REFERENCE CUBE? I'm not sure. This occurs even if I start vrchat without touching the inventory menu, so... if so that's going to be a bit disruptive to testing open beta.\n\nOutput log: https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/81kbq65109buvuo53mpzf/output_log_2025-06-12_19-30-28.zip?rlkey=yvdv03vm5g6ccj53bek00c6wy&st=5bmm7nze&dl=0",
